{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03994","headline":"晦日宴高氏林亭 · 高瑾","name":"晦日宴高氏林亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"试入山亭望，言是石崇家。\n二月风光起，三春桃李华。\n莺吟上乔木，雁往息平沙。\n相看会取醉，宁知还路赊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高瑾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03994.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03994","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}